## Orion Editor (cms.sunstarsys.com)

### Generic Actions

#### redirect

Ingress Endpoint for Orion's CMS interface.

Mandatory Query String Arguments:

- [`uri`](#) - original document.location.href

Optional Query String Arguments:

- [`update`](#) - set to 0 to disable the working copy update
- [`action`](#) - choice of redirect action
- [`lang`](#) - preferred lang for UI
- [`repos`](#) - target Subversion repository name
- [`new`](#) - create a fresh working copy
- [`regex`](#) - PCRE for action=search

#### login

Validates and Caches Subversion Credentials for the current repository. Only responds to the POST method.

